        "TileImage": "$($repository 454d8dc5-6bbf-4ec0-978f-6eee4ed1acb8).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47, we have found the 5 Syndicate Leaders, your targets are, Karl Joakim Mattsson, Otto Keeper, Waldemar Kaufman, Diederik Van Der Heijden, and finally Astrid Gerst. You will only have 8 minutes and 45 seconds to complete the mission. If you don&apos;t kill them and escape in time, the machine will activate killing everyone in the club.\r\rGoodluck Agent 47, a lot of peoples lives depend on you.",
